# UI Library: ShadCN/UI

All UI components must be built using **ShadCN/UI**. Do not use other component libraries (MUI, Ant Design, Chakra, etc.).

## Install a component

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add <component-name>
```

## Usage

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD — use ShadCN components
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
import { Input } from "@/components/ui/input";
import { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from "@/components/ui/card";

// ❌ BAD — do not import from other libraries
import Button from "@mui/material/Button";
```

## Styling

- Use **Tailwind CSS** utility classes for layout and spacing.
- Customise ShadCN components via `className` props, not inline styles.
- Do not install or use any other CSS-in-JS or component libraries.
